 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "# DuckDB Integration with Dataframes\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates using DuckDB for file I/O, SQL queries,\n",
    "table registration, and accelerated operations on dataframes."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "load(\"dataframes-duckdb\")$"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o112",
    "executionCount": 1
   },
   "execution_count": 1,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "## 1. Creating and Exporting Data\n",
    "\n",
    "Build a table in Maxima, then write it to CSV and Parquet."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "sales : df_table(\n",
    "  [\"region\", \"product\", \"price\", \"qty\"],\n",
    "  [df_string_column([\"North\", \"South\", \"North\", \"East\", \"South\",\n",
    "                     \"West\", \"North\", \"East\", \"South\", \"West\",\n",
    "                     \"North\", \"East\"]),\n",
    "   df_string_column([\"Widget\", \"Gadget\", \"Doohickey\", \"Widget\", \"Widget\",\n",
    "                     \"Gadget\", \"Gadget\", \"Doohickey\", \"Doohickey\", \"Widget\",\n",
    "                     \"Widget\", \"Gadget\"]),\n",
    "   ndarray([9.99, 24.99, 4.99, 9.99, 9.99,\n",
    "            24.99, 24.99, 4.99, 4.99, 9.99,\n",
    "            9.99, 24.99]),\n",
    "   ndarray([100.0, 50.0, 200.0, 75.0, 120.0,\n",
    "            30.0, 80.0, 150.0, 90.0, 60.0,\n",
    "            110.0, 45.0])])$"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o116",
    "executionCount": 2
   },
   "execution_count": 2,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "df_write_csv(sales, \"/tmp/sales_demo.csv\")$\n",
    "df_write_parquet(sales, \"/tmp/sales_demo.parquet\")$\n",
    "print(\"Files written to /tmp/\")$"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o122",
    "executionCount": 3
   },
   "execution_count": 3,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "Files written to /tmp/"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "## 2. Reading Data from Files\n",
    "\n",
    "DuckDB auto-detects column types, delimiters, and encoding."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "T_csv : df_read_csv(\"/tmp/sales_demo.csv\")$\n",
    "df_table_shape(T_csv);"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o127",
    "executionCount": 4
   },
   "execution_count": 4,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\left[ 12 , 4 \\right] "
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\left[ 12 , 4 \\right] "
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "T_pq : df_read_parquet(\"/tmp/sales_demo.parquet\")$\n",
    "df_table_shape(T_pq);"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o132",
    "executionCount": 5
   },
   "execution_count": 5,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\left[ 12 , 4 \\right] "
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\left[ 12 , 4 \\right] "
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Verify the CSV round-trip */\n",
    "df_table_names(T_csv);"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o136",
    "executionCount": 6
   },
   "execution_count": 6,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\left[ \\mbox{ region } , \\mbox{ product } , \\mbox{ price } , \\mbox{ qty }\\right] "
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\left[ \\mbox{ region } , \\mbox{ product } , \\mbox{ price } , \\mbox{ qty }\\right] "
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "T_csv;"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o140",
    "executionCount": 7
   },
   "execution_count": 7,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 100.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 50.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Doohickey} & 4.990     & 200.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 75.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 120.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 30.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 80.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Doohickey} & 4.990     & 150.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Doohickey} & 4.990     & 90.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 60.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 110.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 45.00     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{12 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 100.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 50.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Doohickey} & 4.990     & 200.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 75.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 120.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 30.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 80.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Doohickey} & 4.990     & 150.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Doohickey} & 4.990     & 90.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 60.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 110.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 45.00     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{12 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
