  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "## 3. SQL Queries on Files\n",
    "\n",
    "DuckDB can read files directly in SQL — no need to load them into Maxima first."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Query CSV file directly */\n",
    "expensive : df_sql(\"SELECT * FROM read_csv('/tmp/sales_demo.csv') WHERE price > 10\")$\n",
    "expensive;"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o145",
    "executionCount": 8
   },
   "execution_count": 8,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 50.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 30.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 80.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 45.00     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 50.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 30.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 80.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.99     & 45.00     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Aggregation directly on a file */\n",
    "df_sql(\"SELECT region, count(*) AS n, avg(price) AS avg_price \n",
    "        FROM read_csv('/tmp/sales_demo.csv') \n",
    "        GROUP BY region \n",
    "        ORDER BY avg_price DESC\");"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o149",
    "executionCount": 9
   },
   "execution_count": 9,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{lll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{n} & \\textbf{avg\\_price} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{West} & 2.000     & 17.49     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & 3.000     & 13.32     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & 3.000     & 13.32     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & 4.000     & 12.49     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{3 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{lll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{n} & \\textbf{avg\\_price} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{West} & 2.000     & 17.49     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & 3.000     & 13.32     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & 3.000     & 13.32     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & 4.000     & 12.49     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{3 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "## 4. Registering Tables for SQL\n",
    "\n",
    "Register a Maxima `df_table` so it can be queried with SQL by name."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "df_register(sales, \"sales\")$"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o153",
    "executionCount": 10
   },
   "execution_count": 10,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Filter with SQL */\n",
    "df_sql(\"SELECT * FROM sales WHERE region = 'North' AND qty > 100\");"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o157",
    "executionCount": 11
   },
   "execution_count": 11,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & \\text{Doohickey} & 4.990     & 200.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 110.0     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{2 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & \\text{Doohickey} & 4.990     & 200.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 9.990     & 110.0     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{2 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Revenue per region */\n",
    "df_sql(\"SELECT region, \n",
    "               sum(price * qty) AS total_revenue,\n",
    "               count(*) AS num_orders\n",
    "        FROM sales \n",
    "        GROUP BY region \n",
    "        ORDER BY total_revenue DESC\");"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o161",
    "executionCount": 12
   },
   "execution_count": 12,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{lll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{total\\_revenue} & \\textbf{num\\_orders} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & 5095.     & 4.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & 2897.     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & 2622.     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & 1349.     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{3 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{lll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{total\\_revenue} & \\textbf{num\\_orders} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & 5095.     & 4.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & 2897.     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & 2622.     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & 1349.     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{3 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Top product by total quantity sold */\n",
    "df_sql(\"SELECT product, sum(qty) AS total_qty \n",
    "        FROM sales \n",
    "        GROUP BY product \n",
    "        ORDER BY total_qty DESC\");"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o165",
    "executionCount": 13
   },
   "execution_count": 13,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{ll} \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{total\\_qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{Widget} & 465.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Doohickey} & 440.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Gadget} & 205.0     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{3 rows} \\times \\text{2 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{ll} \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{total\\_qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{Widget} & 465.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Doohickey} & 440.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Gadget} & 205.0     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{3 rows} \\times \\text{2 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Window function: rank products by revenue within each region */\n",
    "df_sql(\"SELECT region, product, price * qty AS revenue,\n",
    "               rank() OVER (PARTITION BY region ORDER BY price * qty DESC) AS rank\n",
    "        FROM sales\n",
    "        ORDER BY region, rank\");"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o169",
    "executionCount": 14
   },
   "execution_count": 14,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{revenue} & \\textbf{rank} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{East} & \\text{Gadget} & 1125.     & 1.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 749.3     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Doohickey} & 748.5     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 1999.     & 1.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 1099.     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 999.0     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Doohickey} & 998.0     & 4.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 1250.     & 1.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Widget} & 1199.     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Doohickey} & 449.1     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Gadget} & 749.7     & 1.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Widget} & 599.4     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{12 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{revenue} & \\textbf{rank} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{East} & \\text{Gadget} & 1125.     & 1.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 749.3     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Doohickey} & 748.5     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 1999.     & 1.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 1099.     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 999.0     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Doohickey} & 998.0     & 4.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 1250.     & 1.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Widget} & 1199.     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Doohickey} & 449.1     & 3.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Gadget} & 749.7     & 1.000     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Widget} & 599.4     & 2.000     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{12 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "## 5. Joining Tables with SQL\n",
    "\n",
    "Create a second table and join them via SQL."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Region metadata table */\n",
    "regions : df_table(\n",
    "  [\"region\", \"manager\", \"target\"],\n",
    "  [df_string_column([\"North\", \"South\", \"East\", \"West\"]),\n",
    "   df_string_column([\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Charlie\", \"Diana\"]),\n",
    "   ndarray([5000.0, 4000.0, 3000.0, 2000.0])])$\n",
    "df_register(regions, \"regions\")$\n",
    "regions;"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o175",
    "executionCount": 15
   },
   "execution_count": 15,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{lll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{manager} & \\textbf{target} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & \\text{Alice} & 5000.     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Bob} & 4000.     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Charlie} & 3000.     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Diana} & 2000.     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{3 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{lll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{manager} & \\textbf{target} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & \\text{Alice} & 5000.     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Bob} & 4000.     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Charlie} & 3000.     \\\\\\\\ \\text{West} & \\text{Diana} & 2000.     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{3 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Join sales with region metadata */\n",
    "df_sql(\"SELECT r.manager, r.region, \n",
    "               sum(s.price * s.qty) AS actual_revenue,\n",
    "               r.target,\n",
    "               sum(s.price * s.qty) - r.target AS vs_target\n",
    "        FROM sales s\n",
    "        JOIN regions r ON s.region = r.region\n",
    "        GROUP BY r.manager, r.region, r.target\n",
    "        ORDER BY vs_target DESC\");"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o179",
    "executionCount": 16
   },
   "execution_count": 16,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{lllll} \\textbf{manager} & \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{actual\\_revenue} & \\textbf{target} & \\textbf{vs\\_target} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{Alice} & \\text{North} & 5095.     & 5000.     & 95.10     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Charlie} & \\text{East} & 2622.     & 3000.     & -377.7     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Diana} & \\text{West} & 1349.     & 2000.     & -650.9     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Bob} & \\text{South} & 2897.     & 4000.     & -1103.     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{5 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{lllll} \\textbf{manager} & \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{actual\\_revenue} & \\textbf{target} & \\textbf{vs\\_target} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{Alice} & \\text{North} & 5095.     & 5000.     & 95.10     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Charlie} & \\text{East} & 2622.     & 3000.     & -377.7     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Diana} & \\text{West} & 1349.     & 2000.     & -650.9     \\\\\\\\ \\text{Bob} & \\text{South} & 2897.     & 4000.     & -1103.     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{4 rows} \\times \\text{5 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "## 6. DuckDB-Accelerated Operations\n",
    "\n",
    "These use DuckDB's engine directly, accepting SQL expressions\n",
    "instead of Maxima lambdas."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "/* Filter with SQL expression */\n",
    "df_duckdb_filter(sales, \"price < 10 AND qty >= 100\");"
   ],
   "metadata": {
